AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill provides that, if an employer sponsoring a self-funded health benefit plan authorizes
submission of its claims data to the state's comprehensive health care information system, the
insurance commissioner shall provide that employer access to a utilization report based on de-
identifiedclaimsdatafortheemployer-sponsoredplan.

